@startuml
title S1 - Reserve rental: proposed interaction contract
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide footbox
actor Student
boundary UI
control Reservation
control Core
Student -> UI: Confirm selected vehicle
UI -> Reservation: vehicle, origin, destination, min_soc,\nduration, version, command key
Reservation -> Core: Authenticate and submit reservation intent
Core -> Core: Validate actor / payload; lookup command key
alt Exact replay or key misuse
  Core --> Reservation: Recorded outcome or KEY_REUSE
else Fresh valid intent
  group Atomic Core-coordinated unit of work (M2 ports included)
    Core -> Core: Serialize vehicle + user quota; settle expired claims\nRead authoritative time; recheck state, version and battery
    alt Eligible vehicle and user below live rental limit
      Core -> Core: Create Confirmed reservation + claim\nVehicle Reserved; retain origin occupancy\nexpiry = confirmed_at + 10 min; persist result/event
    else Stale version, competing claim, fault or quota
      Core -> Core: No booking / resource writes\nRecord rejection for this key
    end
  end
  Core --> Reservation: Confirmation or explicit rejection
end
Reservation --> UI: Result, IDs, expiry, server time / reason
UI --> Student: Confirmation deadline or refresh guidance
note over Reservation,Core
  No destination hold. No Trip before pickup.
  Commit failure rolls back the full write set.
  UI timeout means unknown outcome: lookup / retry same key.
end note
@enduml
